From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi7: fix EHT320 mask, RRM/QoS OUI bounds, iwrange, and
 W2W offload

Test EHT320 bandwidth capability as bitmask, bound RRM SSID/QoS OUI lengths, fix iwrange frequency table bounds, and support same-SSID Wi-Fi to Wi-Fi offload.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 mt_wifi/ap/ap_data.c             |  4 +-
 mt_wifi/common/cmm_info.c        |  2 +-
 mt_wifi/common/qos.c             | 66 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 mt_wifi/common/scan.c            |  2 +-
 mt_wifi/feature/rrm/rrm.c        | 15 ++++----
 mt_wifi/feature/rrm/rrm_sanity.c |  7 +++-
 mt_wifi/os/linux/ap_ioctl.c      |  9 +++--
 mt_wifi/protocol/be/mgmt_eht.c   |  2 +-
 8 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

